{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（8日）上午8時33分，警方接報，九龍城一輛巴士及客貨車相撞，客貨車上5名乘客受傷，正坐在路邊等候救援。現場消息指，涉事客貨車由土瓜灣道往啟德方向行駛時，與一輛由宋王臺道駛出的九巴11B線相撞，客貨車內5人受輕傷送院。經初步調查，懷疑是客貨車衝燈肇禍，警方正繼續調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"客貨車車頭嚴重損毀。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140587691331686400684153.jpeg/obVAbsH7Yb4ydcn0NqtVYIknP9devB6niscgoK_HIKA\"/><figcaption>客貨車車頭嚴重損毀。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"車牌及汽車標誌飛脫。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140587688949190656470512.jpeg/CF-w9HyV7W_xmj98YmVbAKJ88gyqSc2QM8D9UhbA_VI\"/><figcaption>車牌及汽車標誌飛脫。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士車身凹陷。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585246316695552271980.jpeg/pjQdgsrmrBcpSLQfSz8LQJ2L1TPxhddOYBTeE0UU3hM\"/><figcaption>巴士車身凹陷。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"巴士車身凹陷。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585249189924864290754.jpeg/4zx_G_hLsNNMyB4BFB6EqTVRk19yHg8uqY9g8oyPYPI\"/><figcaption>巴士車身凹陷。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者在路邊等待救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585251715026944865037.jpeg/w4ph9cKpiGjIhjzF_zQe4EN_doOyAAdYZocHbEOHB2w\"/><figcaption>傷者在路邊等待救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者在路邊等待救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585253892001792580162.jpeg/QROSUiYIntC82wHJE-b2Y5dvTIy5ZnNLRqYfk2OmH5M\"/><figcaption>傷者在路邊等待救援。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有傷者戴上頸箍。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585238754234368541639.jpeg/-z5__mpPo8fdmHDRqkE3LgH9z6tBWK2lVB27THEdu0w\"/><figcaption>有傷者戴上頸箍。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"車頭嚴重損毀。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585241161895936682973.jpeg/yLZZPhY1HYZm4kC7c4E28C8cpuYQoufuBSCw5SAgsOU\"/><figcaption>車頭嚴重損毀。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585243166904320143967.jpeg/fYLubulW0D4AOFeu6BrAymPiK5Pm2xqi7CV7A8klewM\"/><figcaption>有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585245566177280719384.jpeg/qIc8ogV3YBE5-IBkNssw5QKgYRGLVqwIFArmDjEK5g4\"/><figcaption>有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事客貨車。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585247667654656679325.jpeg/3BWieujxLntTjtXDVovui-_1-vPjaN8yX8RPTHrET0w\"/><figcaption>涉事客貨車。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"傷者登上救護車。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585238271889408813692.jpeg/iOTQveEeGZmCGOi9_aLiTJCO4kXkWxYh69BtA87QbQM\"/><figcaption>傷者登上救護車。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585240578887680194803.jpeg/0xdWXzaaco9xOHFkRt9EITc_8hGmFmUdXVN8GXhTfBk\"/><figcaption>有傷者被抬上擔架床。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"客貨車安全氣袋彈出。（鄭嘉惠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260608/1140585242667782144034659.jpeg/CSUS2QockYdjNAq8nFRni3OXlW5t9b__fxr41Foa-NQ\"/><figcaption>客貨車安全氣袋彈出。（鄭嘉惠攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-08T06:03:00.126573+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":14,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}